# bbops exclusions — hostnames/patterns to NEVER touch, one per line.
#
# Use this for out-of-scope subdomains, shared third-party infra, status pages,
# or anything a program lists as explicitly out of scope. Matched as substrings
# against discovered hostnames.
#
# Examples:
# status.example.com
# blog.example.com
# example.com.cdn-provider.net
